1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,800
[Episode 6]

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,400
["Many Advertising Offers for the New Couple"]

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,640
["Nation's Top Sweetheart Choi Yun"]

4
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,350
Nat...

5
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:26,280
Nat.. ion's... Top... Swee...

6
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,810
Mr. Cha!

7
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:42,030
Yun is washing up now.
Will you wait for him for a moment?

8
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:45,880
You have ketchup on your face.

9
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:50,120
No, not there.

10
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:53,900
Hold this. Let me see your face.

11
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:04,300
You're like a sloppy child with food on your face.

12
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:10,260
It's fine. When I meet my mother,
I'll have her wipe it off.

13
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:18,320
Managers represent their stars. You know that, right?

14
00:01:20,390 --> 00:01:24,660
You become a reflection of Yun.

15
00:01:24,660 --> 00:01:31,390
Your behavior, speech, clothing, manners.

16
00:01:31,390 --> 00:01:36,970
Try not to tarnish Yun's image, okay?

17
00:01:40,469 --> 00:01:42,585
Okay.

18
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:47,820
Also, have your clothes dry cleaned every day.

19
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:51,680
And don't go around eating these filthy things.

20
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:55,950
Oh. That's my Yun!

21
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,260
Excuse me.

22
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:02,660
Your picture came out gorgeous, son.

23
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,560
You're glamorous, son!

24
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:13,160
Choi Yun and Kang Minju shoot
many advertisements together...

25
00:02:15,660 --> 00:02:18,680
Let's eat porridge, Yun.

26
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,360
I don't want to.

27
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:23,520
You'll be at the shoot all day.
You won't have any strength.

28
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:28,260
This was made with fresh abalone
from Jeju Island this morning.

29
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:32,490
Hurry, get up. You're a good son.

30
00:02:35,850 --> 00:02:37,070
Ah!

31
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,730
Isn't it delicious?

32
00:02:40,730 --> 00:02:41,900
No.

33
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:50,410
Let's give some to Muhyeok.
He probably hasn't eaten breakfast.

34
00:02:50,410 --> 00:02:52,010
You're crazy.

35
00:02:52,010 --> 00:02:56,120
There's only enough for you, and it's expensive.

36
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:58,420
It's too precious for me to eat, even.

37
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:03,030
It tastes funny.

38
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:36,620
Bro, can you go pick up Minju?

39
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:39,520
Minju's manager is ill.

40
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,390
Will you go get her?

41
00:03:42,550 --> 00:03:45,340
Sure. No problem.

42
00:05:09,290 --> 00:05:10,740
Hello.

43
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:19,700
Even a passing dog wouldn't be ignored like this.

44
00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:23,270
Are you that special?

45
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:25,530
Who do you think you are anyway? What a joke.

46
00:05:28,350 --> 00:05:30,490
Do you want to sleep with me?

47
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:36,050
If you get involved with me,
it'd be till death do us part.

48
00:05:36,050 --> 00:05:38,620
If you haven't got the guts, don't even try.

49
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:45,250
Who on earth does he think he is?

50
00:05:45,890 --> 00:05:46,900
Hey!

51
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:56,690
Hey, do you hear me?

52
00:06:05,910 --> 00:06:06,820
Hey!

53
00:06:29,790 --> 00:06:31,330
This is the right car.

54
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,150
Hey, Mister Gangster!

55
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:30,930
That's for Yun! It's from his fans!

56
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:37,320
Don't eat anymore. It's Yun's!

57
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:40,290
If you want any, buy your own.

58
00:07:40,290 --> 00:07:41,930
Move!

59
00:07:41,930 --> 00:07:47,340
If you can't afford it, tear apart
the restaurant like you did before!

60
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:49,130
I said move!

61
00:07:49,130 --> 00:07:50,900
No.

62
00:07:52,250 --> 00:07:54,680
Why? You want to hit me, too?

63
00:07:55,570 --> 00:07:59,370
Resort to violence one more time,
and that'll be the end of you.

64
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:02,750
I'll leave you and move to Africa!

65
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,130
Eunchae!

66
00:08:08,380 --> 00:08:12,410
What's with you again? Why are you yelling at Muhyeok?

67
00:08:12,410 --> 00:08:18,050
This is for you, but he keeps on eating it.

68
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:24,560
I won't eat it, then! Okay? So petty...

69
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:27,890
You're so petty. It's just food.

70
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:31,010
Let's eat!

71
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:50,320
You should eat slowly.

72
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:56,530
Are you okay?

73
00:08:57,770 --> 00:08:59,070
Are you okay, Yun?

74
00:09:00,430 --> 00:09:03,270
Now what are you up to?

75
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,280
Are you okay?

76
00:09:24,763 --> 00:09:27,266
Action!

77
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,290
How's it coming along?

78
00:09:31,737 --> 00:09:33,150
It's almost done.

79
00:09:48,271 --> 00:09:50,057
How is it?

80
00:09:50,057 --> 00:09:52,322
- Does it taste bad?
- Yeah.

81
00:09:52,322 --> 00:09:54,597
What went wrong?

82
00:09:55,597 --> 00:09:58,350
It's good!

83
00:09:58,350 --> 00:10:00,120
- Really?
- Of course!

84
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,350
Ah, it's hot!

85
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:08,150
Let me see.

86
00:10:14,250 --> 00:10:16,390
It burns.

87
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:36,730
Wait a moment. I got something in my eye.

88
00:10:36,730 --> 00:10:37,950
Yun!

89
00:10:43,460 --> 00:10:46,350
Move your hand.

90
00:10:46,350 --> 00:10:49,780
What is it? It feels big.

91
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:54,020
- Are you okay?
- No. I'm not okay.

92
00:11:15,210 --> 00:11:17,730
Stupid blockhead!

93
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:21,080
Why did you do that?

94
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:25,040
He has Minju. Are you stupid?

95
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:29,180
Stupid blockhead. Stupid stupid...

96
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:34,490
You'll dent the car, blockhead.

97
00:11:47,250 --> 00:11:49,460
That's too much.

98
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:51,460
Bigger.

99
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:53,620
You think that'll come out?

100
00:11:53,620 --> 00:11:57,050
- No...
- Alright, alright. Write it quick.

101
00:11:58,570 --> 00:12:01,780
Hey! You guys.

102
00:12:02,370 --> 00:12:06,660
Tell me your school, grade, and names.

103
00:12:06,660 --> 00:12:08,980
You're all dead.

104
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:11,780
Do you know how harmful rumors are?

105
00:12:11,780 --> 00:12:13,940
You with the red scarf! Give me your name first.

106
00:12:14,750 --> 00:12:18,660
Who the heck are you? So what's your name?

107
00:12:18,660 --> 00:12:21,310
You think this is a game?

108
00:12:22,410 --> 00:12:24,890
You guys. You seem to be Yun's fans

109
00:12:24,890 --> 00:12:27,020
Are these the actions of true fans?

110
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:28,060
Yeah!

111
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:34,350
If you really love Yun, then you
should love the person Yun loves.

112
00:12:34,350 --> 00:12:35,430
No way!

113
00:12:35,430 --> 00:12:37,610
If you really care about Yun...

114
00:12:37,610 --> 00:12:39,190
That's enough.

115
00:12:39,190 --> 00:12:40,630
You little...

116
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:44,010
You're pathetic. Get out of my face.

117
00:12:44,790 --> 00:12:46,920
What a loser!

118
00:12:47,460 --> 00:12:49,610
Why you...

119
00:12:51,730 --> 00:12:55,270
No! You get out of my face, you brats!

120
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:58,470
Yun wouldn't thank fans like you.

121
00:12:58,470 --> 00:13:00,460
What?

122
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,350
Step on her.

123
00:13:02,350 --> 00:13:08,230
Do you want to die?

124
00:13:50,490 --> 00:13:52,140
Good job, Mister.

125
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,520
You listened well and you're much nicer.

126
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:04,350
No matter what happens, just stay out of it.

127
00:14:05,350 --> 00:14:09,750
I get beat up by someone once every two months anyway.

128
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:18,240
Even if I, the girl of your dreams,
gets a little hurt, keep your cool.

129
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,130
Got it?

130
00:14:25,710 --> 00:14:28,590
Violence is bad, regardless.

131
00:14:28,590 --> 00:14:32,770
With how strong you are, you'd have killed them!

132
00:14:38,670 --> 00:14:41,390
Kang... Min... Ju.

133
00:14:42,330 --> 00:14:46,540
Chea... ter...

134
00:14:46,540 --> 00:14:50,790
Don't read it aloud. It's nonsense.

135
00:14:54,130 --> 00:14:56,540
It's so pathetic.

136
00:14:56,540 --> 00:14:59,340
Celebrities can't love anyone
without having a hard time.

137
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:03,500
Why isn't this coming off?

138
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:08,360
I have to erase it all before Yun comes.

139
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:52,450
Grandfather...

140
00:16:53,410 --> 00:16:55,030
Stop it.

141
00:16:55,030 --> 00:16:58,460
Stop crying and eat with me.

142
00:16:58,460 --> 00:17:01,910
You want me to mix that in?

143
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:07,520
You're here.

144
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:10,450
My sister... Where is she?

145
00:17:10,450 --> 00:17:13,360
In the bathroom. She's washing up.

146
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:18,790
Galchi, did you call your uncle?

147
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:25,750
Bad people hit my... my mom!

148
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:29,590
And kissed and stuff when she told them no!

149
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:34,710
It seems that two thugs were
playing a joke on Seo-kyeong.

150
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:39,230
The police came to help before
anything really happened.

151
00:17:39,930 --> 00:17:42,740
She's probably in shock, but she's okay.

152
00:17:42,740 --> 00:17:47,920
It happens every now and again.
Nothing for you to worry about.

153
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:53,370
Why did you call your uncle? You probably worried him.

154
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:59,660
If you haven't eaten yet, sit down and eat with us.

155
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:05,630
Galchi, sit down. It's delicious. Sit!

156
00:18:05,630 --> 00:18:07,340
Come here.

157
00:18:09,300 --> 00:18:10,970
Sit, sit down.

158
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,990
Such a temper.

159
00:18:17,990 --> 00:18:23,120
Galchi, have some. It's delicious.

160
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,300
Seo-kyeong!

161
00:19:21,510 --> 00:19:26,890
Do you... Do you want my help?

162
00:19:58,790 --> 00:20:00,960
If you use this...

163
00:20:02,470 --> 00:20:04,380
It hurts, doesn't it?

164
00:20:23,470 --> 00:20:26,160
I'm sorry.

165
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:33,260
About before... For yelling at you
and screaming at you.

166
00:20:34,740 --> 00:20:36,120
I'm sorry.

167
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:43,490
I won't do it again. I'm sorry.

168
00:20:54,070 --> 00:20:57,400
You're so pretty, my sister.

169
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:05,750
I didn't know how pretty you were.

170
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:17,460
I'll wash it all away for you.

171
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:23,330
Those guys...

172
00:21:26,050 --> 00:21:34,740
Where... Where did they kiss you?

173
00:21:40,230 --> 00:21:43,080
Over here?

174
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:51,780
And?

175
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,810
Here.

176
00:21:59,570 --> 00:22:01,000
And?

177
00:22:03,630 --> 00:22:04,800
Here.

178
00:22:09,860 --> 00:22:15,730
I'll wash it clean.

179
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:19,240
I'll wash it all away for you.

180
00:24:10,560 --> 00:24:12,220
Mom...

181
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:25,740
Mom...

182
00:24:25,740 --> 00:24:27,570
Mom...

183
00:24:28,650 --> 00:24:34,180
Mom...

184
00:25:28,220 --> 00:25:30,000
It's so funny!

185
00:25:52,690 --> 00:25:54,060
Eunchae.

186
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,350
Song Eunchae!

187
00:25:58,540 --> 00:25:59,980
Oh, Dad.

188
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:06,350
Do you want to have a drink with me?

189
00:26:06,350 --> 00:26:08,100
Sure.

190
00:26:08,100 --> 00:26:11,840
But we don't have any soju. I'll go and buy some now.

191
00:26:18,745 --> 00:26:21,600
I get 5 points!

192
00:26:25,763 --> 00:26:27,845
Yes!

193
00:26:31,689 --> 00:26:34,990
Oh my, I got so unlucky!

194
00:26:34,990 --> 00:26:36,490
You can have it.

195
00:26:43,580 --> 00:26:44,970
Blockhead.

196
00:26:52,290 --> 00:26:53,820
Mister?

197
00:26:57,370 --> 00:26:59,800
Why are you here at this time?

198
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:02,190
Give me...

199
00:27:03,890 --> 00:27:05,600
Give me a hug.

200
00:27:06,530 --> 00:27:07,950
Huh?

201
00:27:07,950 --> 00:27:14,330
Like with Yun. Just one hug.

202
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:20,180
Have you been drinking?

203
00:27:23,370 --> 00:27:25,890
Hug me, just once.

204
00:27:38,390 --> 00:27:41,190
Get up and go home.

205
00:27:41,190 --> 00:27:43,880
It's cold. You'll catch a cold.

206
00:28:36,780 --> 00:28:38,260
Mister!

207
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:41,410
Mister Pervert!

208
00:28:46,710 --> 00:28:48,480
Mister Gangster!

209
00:29:53,730 --> 00:29:54,860
Hello.

210
00:30:07,610 --> 00:30:09,020
Choi Yun.

211
00:30:24,620 --> 00:30:27,460
Excuse me. Do you have any sweet buns?

212
00:30:27,460 --> 00:30:29,800
Hey, Minchae! Isn't this your sister?

213
00:30:35,570 --> 00:30:36,400
Here!

214
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:38,790
Eunchae! Eunchae!

215
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:44,050
Choi Yun and his coordinator, Song, appear to have been

216
00:30:44,050 --> 00:30:46,910
romantically involved since before Choi Yun's debut.

217
00:30:46,910 --> 00:30:51,340
Choi Yun, who has been dating scandal queen Minju,

218
00:30:51,340 --> 00:30:54,720
was previously hailed as
Korea's good and honest sweetheart,

219
00:30:54,720 --> 00:30:57,130
but he now shows his true colors.

220
00:30:57,130 --> 00:31:02,410
The news of Ms. Song and Yun, high school friends,
is shocking to all.

221
00:31:02,410 --> 00:31:07,340
Goodness! I knew this day would come.

222
00:31:07,340 --> 00:31:11,410
Since it's in the open, are you guys really friends?

223
00:31:11,410 --> 00:31:13,500
People would sooner guess
you two were a married couple!

224
00:31:13,500 --> 00:31:14,980
That's what I'm saying.

225
00:31:14,980 --> 00:31:16,820
Even if she doesn't know her friends' phone numbers,

226
00:31:16,820 --> 00:31:20,450
she probably has all of Yun's
friends' phone numbers memorized.

227
00:31:20,450 --> 00:31:22,240
That's what I'm saying!

228
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:25,190
If I told her to pick out his
underpants from a line up of ten,

229
00:31:25,190 --> 00:31:27,930
Eunchae could do it.
Not even Yun's mother would know, but she would.

230
00:31:27,930 --> 00:31:29,380
That's what I'm saying.

231
00:31:29,380 --> 00:31:31,970
Eunchae's bra size, underwear size, shoe size.

232
00:31:31,970 --> 00:31:34,350
I don't even know them but Yun knows!

233
00:31:34,350 --> 00:31:35,750
That's what I'm saying!

234
00:31:35,750 --> 00:31:38,760
You people are no help at all.

235
00:31:38,760 --> 00:31:43,630
So what's your point? That the news article is true?

236
00:31:43,630 --> 00:31:46,830
No! Not that! What we're saying is...

237
00:31:48,910 --> 00:31:53,870
What are we saying?

238
00:31:56,090 --> 00:32:01,290
Well. You were blabbing. I didn't say much.

239
00:32:06,450 --> 00:32:08,100
Who is it?

240
00:32:08,100 --> 00:32:13,180
Who took those absurd photos?
Who is attacking my son like this?

241
00:32:13,180 --> 00:32:17,170
Whoever he is, bring him to me!

242
00:32:17,170 --> 00:32:21,040
Find him, wherever he is.

243
00:32:21,040 --> 00:32:22,520
Calm down, ma'am.

244
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:25,370
How can I stay calm?

245
00:32:25,370 --> 00:32:31,860
This is ruining my Yun's image.

246
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:38,130
Three commercials have been cancelled.

247
00:32:38,130 --> 00:32:43,280
We'll have to pay the contract violation damages
in the lipstick ad too!

248
00:32:43,280 --> 00:32:46,610
My heart is racing.

249
00:32:47,860 --> 00:32:50,270
Should I get you some medicine?

250
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:55,400
You started this and now you try to help?

251
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:59,760
I mean, is Eunchae out of her mind?

252
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:06,640
Yun is soft-hearted. There's nothing we can do
about him, but she should've been careful!

253
00:33:07,770 --> 00:33:09,260
I apologize.

254
00:33:10,330 --> 00:33:12,840
What would people think of Yun?

255
00:33:12,840 --> 00:33:17,180
That he's a perverted Casanova who's
on and off with his friend?

256
00:33:17,180 --> 00:33:22,970
Why Eunchae of all people?
Yun's of a whole different class!

257
00:33:22,970 --> 00:33:24,890
What do you mean by that?

258
00:33:25,820 --> 00:33:26,820
What?

259
00:33:26,820 --> 00:33:28,940
She's a coordinator, so what?

260
00:33:28,940 --> 00:33:32,840
Is a star so special?
Do celebrities fall from heaven?

261
00:33:32,840 --> 00:33:35,120
The way I see it, they're all the same.

262
00:33:35,120 --> 00:33:36,040
Hey.

263
00:33:36,040 --> 00:33:38,270
Eunchae does have strength.

264
00:33:38,270 --> 00:33:41,870
She's 100 times stronger than your son.

265
00:33:41,870 --> 00:33:43,470
Are you out of your mind?

266
00:33:43,470 --> 00:33:48,150
I can endure anything, but I won't
let you insult my daughter!

267
00:33:48,150 --> 00:33:50,380
So hold your tongue, you brat!

268
00:33:53,970 --> 00:33:55,280
Yun!

269
00:33:57,370 --> 00:34:00,050
Where are you going?

270
00:34:07,980 --> 00:34:09,320
Yun...

271
00:34:53,250 --> 00:34:54,510
Minju.

272
00:36:06,827 --> 00:36:09,610
Recipient did not answer.

273
00:36:09,610 --> 00:36:12,800
Where are you, Yun?

274
00:36:28,870 --> 00:36:29,900
Minju.

275
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:05,830
Sweet potato.

276
00:38:05,830 --> 00:38:09,908
[Sweet potado]

277
00:38:16,910 --> 00:38:18,950
Don't cheat!

278
00:38:19,620 --> 00:38:20,970
I'm not.

279
00:38:20,970 --> 00:38:22,390
Let's see.

280
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:27,840
Both of you are pretty stupid.

281
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:31,020
After all I've taught,
you still can't spell "sweet potato"?

282
00:38:31,020 --> 00:38:33,560
It's so easy! Sweet potato.

283
00:38:33,560 --> 00:38:35,960
Well, that's what I wrote.

284
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:38,200
How is that sweet potato?

285
00:38:42,550 --> 00:38:44,680
This is how you spell it.

286
00:38:47,080 --> 00:38:49,100
Another one then.

287
00:38:50,220 --> 00:38:52,000
Potato.

288
00:39:09,540 --> 00:39:14,690
[Korea's Sweetheart Choi Yun Has Haters For First Time]
[Ad deals canceled over blow to image]

289
00:39:18,790 --> 00:39:24,340
"Yun's agency has not released any official statement.

290
00:39:24,340 --> 00:39:30,930
Rumors about Choi Yun and the Song family
are leaking constantly.

291
00:39:30,930 --> 00:39:35,400
The two are still living in the same house."

292
00:39:57,690 --> 00:40:00,580
What's going to happen to Yun?

293
00:40:00,580 --> 00:40:05,020
If I were Eunchae, I'd hold onto him really tight.

294
00:40:05,020 --> 00:40:08,470
How do you function with a brain like that?

295
00:40:08,470 --> 00:40:10,370
Do you want to live like this?

296
00:40:10,370 --> 00:40:14,240
Yes. This is the way I live.
What are you going to do about it?

297
00:40:14,240 --> 00:40:17,270
Just because you're tall.

298
00:40:17,270 --> 00:40:20,100
Let's go to the market. Buy me steamed bread, sister.

299
00:40:20,100 --> 00:40:22,370
- You don't have money?
- No... Let's go.

300
00:40:25,519 --> 00:40:30,860
- Hi.
- Hi.

301
00:40:57,310 --> 00:41:00,270
I've experienced it before, so I know.

302
00:41:00,270 --> 00:41:02,710
It's nothing for you to cry over.

303
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:05,800
Gosh!

304
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:08,890
So why do something that'd cause a scandal?

305
00:41:08,890 --> 00:41:12,530
You two are too close even in my eyes.
It's more than close.

306
00:41:12,530 --> 00:41:15,970
You took off your underwear in front of her, right?

307
00:41:15,970 --> 00:41:20,150
Shouldn't she have been more careful?

308
00:41:20,150 --> 00:41:25,320
You have a girlfriend now. She should act accordingly.

309
00:41:25,320 --> 00:41:30,090
I told Eunchae to keep her distance
from you for a while.

310
00:41:30,090 --> 00:41:32,870
I know a good coordinator.

311
00:41:32,870 --> 00:41:35,260
Do you want to have someone take her place?

312
00:41:36,720 --> 00:41:40,210
All right. I won't do that.

313
00:41:50,190 --> 00:41:51,550
Eunchae!

314
00:41:54,310 --> 00:41:58,510
Our Yun has been up since morning
and has been crying for four hours now.

315
00:41:58,510 --> 00:42:01,200
What can we do? He'll probably die if we let him.

316
00:42:02,570 --> 00:42:05,740
I feel like dying myself.

317
00:42:05,740 --> 00:42:08,100
You go and try to comfort Yun.

318
00:42:24,550 --> 00:42:30,300
Oh, what a loser. You cry just because of some news?

319
00:42:30,300 --> 00:42:35,230
You're like a baby. Should I bring your bottle, baby?

320
00:42:35,230 --> 00:42:37,930
This would have been a good headline.

321
00:42:37,930 --> 00:42:42,450
"Popular singer Choi Yun is the biggest baby ever!"

322
00:42:44,150 --> 00:42:47,170
What are you staring at?
If it weren't true, you wouldn't be like this.

323
00:42:47,170 --> 00:42:50,450
The fact that you love Minju is obvious to everyone.

324
00:42:50,450 --> 00:42:56,000
And you and I being friends only, God and Buddha know.

325
00:42:56,000 --> 00:43:00,580
Even with those shoots canceled,
you can still make a living.

326
00:43:00,580 --> 00:43:02,970
Is it about your image?

327
00:43:02,970 --> 00:43:05,170
I'll go to reporters and clear things up.

328
00:43:05,170 --> 00:43:08,520
- Who says it's because of that?
- Then what?

329
00:43:10,560 --> 00:43:13,000
Minju won't look at me.

330
00:43:14,820 --> 00:43:19,000
It'd be great if she even got a little angry
but she's not even angry.

331
00:43:20,190 --> 00:43:24,620
I was at Minju's house for ten hours.

332
00:43:24,620 --> 00:43:30,940
All she did was play video games.
She didn't even look at me once.

333
00:43:33,090 --> 00:43:36,650
Minju and I've come this far.

334
00:43:36,650 --> 00:43:39,700
What will I do if Minju dumps me?

335
00:43:42,460 --> 00:43:45,050
Then I'm going to kill myself.

336
00:43:46,970 --> 00:43:48,940
I'm going to kill myself then.

337
00:43:51,840 --> 00:43:53,180
Die...

338
00:43:54,350 --> 00:43:56,100
Then just die.

339
00:44:20,380 --> 00:44:24,420
Go upstairs... Yun isn't crying anymore.

340
00:45:10,040 --> 00:45:11,930
Where's Yun?

341
00:45:11,930 --> 00:45:16,080
You must not have heard. His shoot was cancelled today.

342
00:45:18,010 --> 00:45:20,150
Did the assistant call you?

343
00:45:21,350 --> 00:45:23,040
Then you can leave.

344
00:45:28,100 --> 00:45:29,820
Isn't that Song Eunchae?

345
00:45:29,820 --> 00:45:31,540
Are you Song Eunchae? Please let us interview you.

346
00:45:31,540 --> 00:45:33,190
Are the news reports about your relationship true?

347
00:45:33,190 --> 00:45:35,080
What was your first thought? Reaction?

348
00:45:36,020 --> 00:45:37,300
What is this?

349
00:45:37,300 --> 00:45:39,740
Put that away! Go!

350
00:45:39,740 --> 00:45:44,200
How do you feel right now?

351
00:45:45,040 --> 00:45:47,410
- Go!
- Song Eunchae, will you tell us your thoughts?

352
00:45:48,270 --> 00:45:50,250
Song Eunchae! Song Eunchae!

353
00:45:50,250 --> 00:45:51,540
Wait! One moment.

354
00:45:52,970 --> 00:45:55,800
If you put away the cameras,
I'll give you an interview.

355
00:46:00,410 --> 00:46:04,550
Yun and I were born in the same house

356
00:46:04,550 --> 00:46:08,150
and for 25 years we'd been friends.

357
00:46:08,150 --> 00:46:12,820
We were breastfed by the same mother
and raised like twins.

358
00:46:13,670 --> 00:46:17,710
My father is Yun's mother's chauffer.

359
00:46:17,710 --> 00:46:21,980
And my mother is their maid.

360
00:46:21,980 --> 00:46:26,730
My family rents out the basement room of Yun's house.

361
00:46:28,690 --> 00:46:34,510
If I had ever had feelings for Yun,

362
00:46:34,510 --> 00:46:41,680
I would have been too ashamed to
live under such conditions,

363
00:46:41,680 --> 00:46:44,780
and would have moved out.

364
00:46:46,640 --> 00:46:49,360
I'm sure Yun feels the same way.

365
00:46:51,300 --> 00:46:56,960
Even if only for a moment,
if he ever had feelings for me,

366
00:46:57,860 --> 00:47:01,220
he wouldn't tell me how much he loves Minju,

367
00:47:01,220 --> 00:47:06,990
how his life is precious because of her,

368
00:47:06,990 --> 00:47:10,980
or how he wants to die because of her.

369
00:47:10,980 --> 00:47:14,090
He couldn't have told those things to me.

370
00:47:20,010 --> 00:47:22,500
Are there any other questions you'd like to ask?

371
00:48:03,780 --> 00:48:05,420
Start the music!

372
00:49:51,170 --> 00:49:54,250
Yun is the one I stabbed.

373
00:49:55,970 --> 00:50:01,270
So why are you the one bleeding? Blockhead.

374
00:50:50,580 --> 00:50:52,080
Go.

375
00:50:52,080 --> 00:50:55,270
Why'd you come here? Go.

376
00:50:56,560 --> 00:50:57,970
Minju!

377
00:50:59,170 --> 00:51:01,170
I told you not to find me.

378
00:51:01,170 --> 00:51:03,810
I told you not to find me!

379
00:51:03,810 --> 00:51:05,240
Minju!

380
00:51:05,240 --> 00:51:09,270
Before people see this, leave. Leave now!

381
00:51:09,270 --> 00:51:11,370
Minju... Please...

382
00:51:11,370 --> 00:51:16,610
Mom, Dad will kill both of us! Don't you know that?

383
00:51:18,470 --> 00:51:20,710
I won't come again.

384
00:51:20,710 --> 00:51:24,370
I won't come again, so...

385
00:51:24,370 --> 00:51:28,540
So have dinner with me once.

386
00:51:29,480 --> 00:51:34,340
I have a room at the Seoul hotel, so come there.

387
00:51:34,340 --> 00:51:39,070
If you're scared of your father, then come there.

388
00:51:41,000 --> 00:51:42,880
Listen carefully.

389
00:51:42,880 --> 00:51:45,340
My relationship with you ended

390
00:51:45,340 --> 00:51:51,210
when you took Dad away from me. It was over then.

391
00:51:51,210 --> 00:51:53,100
Don't be so pathetic. Go.

392
00:51:53,100 --> 00:51:56,250
Minju!

393
00:51:56,250 --> 00:51:59,100
Go, go, Mom!

394
00:51:59,100 --> 00:52:02,120
I'm not your daughter anymore!

395
00:52:02,120 --> 00:52:03,420
Minju...

396
00:53:42,130 --> 00:53:43,580
Do you need help?

397
00:53:43,580 --> 00:53:46,870
I lost my car keys...

398
00:54:07,620 --> 00:54:09,400
Where do you want to go?

399
00:55:36,760 --> 00:55:38,520
I warned you, didn't I?

400
00:55:39,880 --> 00:55:42,620
That if you lack the confidence,
you shouldn't mess with me.

401
00:55:44,300 --> 00:55:49,620
If you get involved with me,
it'd be till death do us part.

402
00:55:49,620 --> 00:55:51,300
Didn't I say that?

403
00:55:55,150 --> 00:55:59,090
So then... Why approach me?

404
00:56:51,160 --> 00:56:52,770
Minju...

405
00:57:11,686 --> 00:57:13,758
[Episode 7 Preview]

406
00:57:13,758 --> 00:57:16,470
I don't think I'll ever find someone who'll

407
00:57:16,470 --> 00:57:19,181
like me as much as he does.

408
00:57:19,181 --> 00:57:21,863
Blockhead! Blockhead!

409
00:57:24,561 --> 00:57:28,534
[Sorry, if she is mine]

410
00:57:28,534 --> 00:57:31,054
Well, you are nice.

411
00:57:31,054 --> 00:57:34,681
You learned Korean. You like kimchi.

412
00:57:34,681 --> 00:57:37,587
I'm so proud of you, mister.

413
00:57:48,031 --> 00:57:50,478
[Love, I'll just stop everything here]

414
00:57:50,478 --> 00:57:54,246
You've never put on lotion before?

415
00:57:55,324 --> 00:58:01,115
Warm, fresh seaweed rolls for sale!
